gxp 2

given
  k1 = circle(O)
    r1: r(k1) = 2
  segment OA
    d1: |OA| = 5

construct
  B = tangent(A, k1)
  segment AB
  C = tangent(A, k1)
  segment AC

find
  d2: |AB|
  d3: |AC|
  d4: dist(B, C)
  θ1: angle(AB, CA)

